--[[                
    FORGE v6.1
    Single-file loader: fetches x64ui (CONFIG.LibraryURLs), then builds aim assist, ESP,
    NPC/bot tracking, radar, target HUD, and the CCTV monitor.

    v6.2: CCTV monitor has sharp corners, no REC/time chip, and the enemy-vision/FOV-cone
    features are removed (aim FOV circle kept). Eye mode removed.

    v6.1: CCTV and menu sections are scoped in do-blocks to stay under Luau's
    200-active-locals limit per function ("Out of local registers").

    Not tested in a Roblox client.
    Madium docs were unreachable while writing. The Drawing, hookmetamethod and
    request contracts follow sUNC conventions and the x64ui example.
    The namecall hook stays installed as an inactive pass-through after unload.
    Dex++ is third-party code and is not unloaded by FORGE.

    CCTV WORLD RENDERING (ViewportFrame cannot show the live world, so it is rebuilt locally)
      Terrain       Rebuilt from Terrain:ReadVoxels as 4-stud blocks with real material colors,
                    water included. Approximation: no smooth slopes, no grass decoration.
      Parts         Cloned in batches, nearest first, from GetPartBoundsInRadius.
                    Parts with CanQuery = false are not found by that query.
      Characters    Tracked characters are pose-synced live clones, never static ghosts.
      Sky/lighting  Sky is cloned (ViewportFrame Sky support is unverified); sun direction,
                    ambient and tint are mirrored. Atmosphere, fog, post-processing, particles,
                    beams, trails, billboards, SurfaceGuis and sounds are not rendered.
      Streaming     With StreamingEnabled only the streamed area exists to be cloned.
      Archivable    CCTVForceArchivable briefly sets Archivable = true on non-archivable
                    instances to clone them, then restores false.
]]

